    'famous-winter-sports-rivalries',
    '{"en": "Famous Winter Sports Rivalries: Battles That Defined Eras", "de": "Berühmte Wintersport-Rivalitäten: Kämpfe, die Epochen definierten", "fr": "Rivalités célèbres des sports d''hiver : Batailles qui ont défini des époques", "it": "Famose rivalità degli sport invernali: Battaglie che hanno definito epoche", "es": "Rivalidades famosas de deportes de invierno: Batallas que definieron épocas", "pt": "Rivalidades famosas dos esportes de inverno: Batalhas que definiram eras", "nl": "Beroemde wintersportrivialiteiten: Gevechten die tijdperken definieerden", "ar": "التنافسات الشهيرة في الرياضات الشتوية: معارك حددت العصور", "ja": "有名なウィンタースポーツのライバル関係：時代を定義した戦い", "zh": "Zhunmingde Dongji Yundong Jingzheng: Dingyi Shidai de Zhandou", "ko": "유명한 동계 스포츠 라이벌: 시대를 정의한 대결"}'::jsonb,
    '{"en": "The greatest athletes push each other to extraordinary heights. Winter sports has seen legendary rivalries that captivated fans and elevated competition to new levels.", "de": "Die größten Athleten treiben sich gegenseitig zu außergewöhnlichen Höhen. Der Wintersport hat legendäre Rivalitäten gesehen.", "fr": "Les plus grands athlètes se poussent mutuellement vers des sommets extraordinaires. Les sports d''hiver ont connu des rivalités légendaires.", "it": "I più grandi atleti si spingono a vicenda verso vette straordinarie. Gli sport invernali hanno visto rivalità leggendarie.", "es": "Los mejores atletas se empujan mutuamente a alturas extraordinarias. Los deportes de invierno han visto rivalidades legendarias.", "pt": "Os maiores atletas se empurram mutuamente a alturas extraordinárias. Os esportes de inverno viram rivalidades lendárias.", "nl": "De grootste atleten pushen elkaar naar buitengewone hoogten. De wintersport heeft legendarische rivaliteiten gezien.", "ar": "يدفع أعظم الرياضيين بعضهم البعض إلى ارتفاعات استثنائية. شهدت الرياضات الشتوية تنافسات أسطورية", "ja": "最も偉大なアスリートは互いを驚異的な高みへと押し上げます。ウィンタースポーツには伝説的なライバル関係がありました。", "zh": "Zuiweida de yundongyuan hu xiang tuijin dao feichangde gaodu. Dongji yundong jianzheng le chuanqi de jingzheng.", "ko": "가장 위대한 선수들은 서로를 비범한 높이로 밀어붙입니다. 동계 스포츠에는 전설적인 라이벌이 있었습니다."}'::jsonb,
    '{"en": "<p>Competition at the highest level often comes down to a few athletes who push each other beyond what seemed possible. Winter sports has been blessed with rivalries that transcended sport to become cultural events.</p><h2>Stenmark vs. The World</h2><p>Sweden''s Ingemar Stenmark dominated slalom and giant slalom in the late 1970s and early 1980s with a technical perfection that seemed inhuman. His 86 World Cup victories stood as the record for nearly four decades.</p><p>More than any single rival, Stenmark battled the entire field, forcing competitors to reimagine what was possible in technical skiing. His battles with Phil Mahre, Marc Girardelli, and others defined an era.</p><h2>Hirscher vs. Kristoffersen</h2><p>Austria''s <a href=\"/marcel-hirscher-profile/\">Marcel Hirscher</a> won eight consecutive overall World Cup titles, a streak of dominance unprecedented in alpine skiing. His primary challenger was Norway''s <a href=\"/henrik-kristoffersen-profile/\">Henrik Kristoffersen</a>.</p><p>Their battles in slalom were legendary. Kristoffersen''s aggressive attacking style contrasted with Hirscher''s precise efficiency. When they raced, the skiing world watched.</p><h2>Fourcade vs. Bjørndalen</h2><p>France''s Martin Fourcade and Norway''s Ole Einar Bjørndalen represented different biathlon generations who briefly overlapped. Bjørndalen''s record 13 world championship golds seemed untouchable until Fourcade began his assault on the sport.</p><p>Their duels in the shooting range and on the trails captivated biathlon fans worldwide. Modern stars like <a href=\"/johannes-boe-profile/\">Johannes Thingnes Bø</a> now carry on this tradition.</p><h2>Johaug vs. Björgen</h2><p>Norway''s <a href=\"/therese-johaug-profile/\">Therese Johaug</a> and Marit Björgen were teammates who became rivals at the highest level. Björgen''s record medal haul and Johaug''s endurance dominance created an internal Norwegian battle that elevated both athletes.</p><p>Their competition helped make Norway''s cross-country team the world''s dominant force.</p><h2>Modern Rivalries</h2><p>Today''s World Cup features compelling rivalries across every discipline:</p><p>In alpine skiing, <a href=\"/marco-odermatt-profile/\">Marco Odermatt</a> faces challenges from young talents across multiple disciplines. <a href=\"/mikaela-shiffrin-profile/\">Mikaela Shiffrin</a> has dominated women''s skiing while <a href=\"/petra-vlhova-profile/\">Petra Vlhová</a> and <a href=\"/lara-gut-behrami-profile/\">Lara Gut-Behrami</a> push her constantly.</p><p>In ski jumping, <a href=\"/stefan-kraft-profile/\">Stefan Kraft</a>, <a href=\"/ryoyu-kobayashi-profile/\">Ryoyu Kobayashi</a>, and <a href=\"/halvor-granerud-profile/\">Halvor Egner Granerud</a> trade victories week after week.</p><p>In biathlon, <a href=\"/johannes-boe-profile/\">Johannes Thingnes Bø</a> has faced a new generation of challengers including <a href=\"/eric-lesser-profile/\">Emilien Jacquelin</a> and <a href=\"/sebastian-samuelsson-profile/\">Sebastian Samuelsson</a>.</p><h2>Why Rivalries Matter</h2><p>Great rivalries elevate sport beyond individual achievement. When two or more athletes push each other, they often achieve more than either could alone. Their battles create narratives that draw casual fans into the sport.</p><p>The next great rivalry is always emerging, waiting to captivate a new generation.</p>", "de": "<p>Wettkampf auf höchstem Niveau kommt oft auf wenige Athleten an, die sich gegenseitig über das scheinbar Mögliche hinaus antreiben. Der Wintersport war gesegnet mit Rivalitäten, die den Sport transzendierten.</p><h2>Stenmark gegen die Welt</h2><p>Schwedens Ingemar Stenmark dominierte Slalom und Riesenslalom in den späten 1970ern und frühen 1980ern mit technischer Perfektion.</p><h2>Hirscher gegen Kristoffersen</h2><p>Österreichs <a href=\"/marcel-hirscher-profile/\">Marcel Hirscher</a> gewann acht aufeinanderfolgende Gesamtweltcup-Titel. Sein primärer Herausforderer war Norwegens <a href=\"/henrik-kristoffersen-profile/\">Henrik Kristoffersen</a>.</p><h2>Moderne Rivalitäten</h2><p>Im alpinen Skifahren stellt sich <a href=\"/marco-odermatt-profile/\">Marco Odermatt</a> Herausforderungen aus vielen Disziplinen.</p>", "fr": "<p>La compétition au plus haut niveau se résume souvent à quelques athlètes qui se poussent au-delà de ce qui semblait possible.</p><h2>Stenmark contre le monde</h2><p>Le Suédois Ingemar Stenmark a dominé le slalom et le slalom géant à la fin des années 1970 et au début des années 1980.</p><h2>Hirscher contre Kristoffersen</h2><p>L''Autrichien <a href=\"/marcel-hirscher-profile/\">Marcel Hirscher</a> a remporté huit titres consécutifs au classement général de la Coupe du monde. Son principal challenger était le Norvégien <a href=\"/henrik-kristoffersen-profile/\">Henrik Kristoffersen</a>.</p>", "it": "<p>La competizione ai massimi livelli spesso si riduce a pochi atleti che si spingono oltre ciò che sembrava possibile.</p><h2>Stenmark contro il mondo</h2><p>Lo svedese Ingemar Stenmark dominò slalom e slalom gigante alla fine degli anni ''70 e all''inizio degli anni ''80.</p><h2>Hirscher contro Kristoffersen</h2><p>L''austriaco <a href=\"/marcel-hirscher-profile/\">Marcel Hirscher</a> ha vinto otto titoli consecutivi nella Coppa del Mondo generale.</p>", "es": "<p>La competición al más alto nivel a menudo se reduce a unos pocos atletas que se empujan más allá de lo que parecía posible.</p><h2>Stenmark contra el mundo</h2><p>El sueco Ingemar Stenmark dominó el slalom y el slalom gigante a finales de los 70 y principios de los 80.</p>", "pt": "<p>A competição no mais alto nível geralmente se resume a alguns atletas que se empurram além do que parecia possível.</p><h2>Stenmark contra o mundo</h2><p>O sueco Ingemar Stenmark dominou o slalom e o slalom gigante no final dos anos 1970 e início dos anos 1980.</p>", "nl": "<p>Competitie op het hoogste niveau komt vaak neer op een paar atleten die elkaar voorbij wat mogelijk leek pushen.</p><h2>Stenmark tegen de wereld</h2><p>De Zweed Ingemar Stenmark domineerde slalom en reuzenslalom in de late jaren 1970 en vroege jaren 1980.</p>", "ar": "<p>غالباً ما تتلخص المنافسة على أعلى مستوى في عدد قليل من الرياضيين الذين يدفعون بعضهم البعض إلى ما وراء ما بدا ممكناً.</p><h2>ستنمارك ضد العالم</h2><p>هيمن السويدي إنجمار ستنمارك على التعرج والتعرج العملاق في أواخر السبعينيات وأوائل الثمانينيات.</p>", "ja": "<p>最高レベルの競争は、しばしば可能と思われることを超えて互いを押し上げる数人のアスリートに帰着します。</p><h2>ステンマルク対世界</h2><p>スウェーデンのインゲマール・ステンマルクは、1970年代後半から1980年代前半にかけてスラロームと大回転を支配しました。</p>", "zh": "<p>Zuigao shuiping de jingzheng tongchang guijie yu ji ge yundongyuan hu xiang tuijin chaochu keneng de fanchow.</p><h2>Stenmark dui shijie</h2><p>Ruidian de Ingemar Stenmark zai 1970 niandai mo he 1980 niandai chu tongzhi le huixue he da huixue.</p>", "ko": "<p>최고 수준의 경쟁은 종종 가능해 보이는 것 이상으로 서로를 밀어붙이는 몇몇 선수들로 귀결됩니다.</p><h2>스텐마르크 대 세계</h2><p>스웨덴의 잉게마르 스텐마르크는 1970년대 후반과 1980년대 초반에 슬라럼과 대회전을 지배했습니다.</p>"}'::jsonb,
    'historical',
    NULL,
    '{"en": "Famous winter sports rivalries - Legendary battles from Stenmark to Hirscher vs Kristoffersen that defined eras and elevated competition.", "de": "Berühmte Wintersport-Rivalitäten - Legendäre Kämpfe von Stenmark bis Hirscher gegen Kristoffersen.", "fr": "Rivalités célèbres des sports d''hiver - Batailles légendaires de Stenmark à Hirscher contre Kristoffersen.", "it": "Famose rivalità degli sport invernali - Battaglie leggendarie da Stenmark a Hirscher contro Kristoffersen.", "es": "Rivalidades famosas de deportes de invierno - Batallas legendarias desde Stenmark hasta Hirscher contra Kristoffersen.", "pt": "Rivalidades famosas dos esportes de inverno - Batalhas lendárias de Stenmark a Hirscher contra Kristoffersen.", "nl": "Beroemde wintersportrivaliteiten - Legendarische gevechten van Stenmark tot Hirscher tegen Kristoffersen.", "ar": "التنافسات الشهيرة في الرياضات الشتوية - معارك أسطورية من ستنمارك إلى هيرشر ضد كريستوفرسن", "ja": "有名なウィンタースポーツのライバル関係 - ステンマルクからヒルシャー対クリストファーセンまでの伝説的な戦い", "zh": "Zhunmingde dongji yundong jingzheng - Cong Stenmark dao Hirscher dui Kristoffersen de chuanqi zhandou", "ko": "유명한 동계 스포츠 라이벌 - 스텐마르크에서 히르셔 대 크리스토퍼센까지 전설적인 대결"}'::jsonb,
